# Domains to redirect. Copy to domains.txt and edit.
#
# Format:  <apex-domain> [<target-url>]
#
# The target URL is optional. When omitted the domain uses --target (or
# TARGET_URL from the config file). Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# List APEX domains only — do NOT list www.*. The tool configures the apex and
# www for each entry, and scopes the redirect rule to exactly those two
# hostnames, so any other subdomain on the zone stays free for future use.

# Simple case: everything goes to the default target.
oldbrand.com
oldbrand.net
oldbrand.org

# Typo-catchers.
oldbrnad.com
old-brand.com

# Per-domain targets override the default.
acquired-product.io      https://example.com/products/acquired
summer-campaign.co       https://example.com/promo/summer
